*5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ghost Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**12 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**6 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**7 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.

